# oc-sim scenario v1
# Open the app menu with up and down, step up from the first entry to SETUP
# (the last one), confirm with the right encoder, move down two lines to
# ROTATE with the left encoder, and turn the right encoder once: the whole
# screen, settings included, is drawn upside down from then on, before any
# save (journal/D-026).
ticks 200
20  button up down
20  button down down
40  button up up
40  button down up
60  button up down
66  button up up
90  button right down
96  button right up
120 encoder 1 +2
140 encoder 2 +1
